  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Spellcasters fear your devastating missiles.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Disrupting Shot<sup>APG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> The DC of the concentration check required when you strike a spellcasting target with your readied shot increases by an amount equal to your mythic tier. This stacks with the penalty from Disrupting Shot. In addition, if you expend one use of your mythic power the target must continue to make concentration checks (DC 20 + spell level) to cast spells for a number of rounds equal to one-half your mythic tier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc83\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
